cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TargetDesign-workbench"
abstract: >-
  TargetDesign-workbench is a motif-first toolkit for CRISPR guide design.
  Motif patterns are defined first, candidate regions are extracted, exact,
  indexed, BLAST-based and model-based off-target searches are run, and
  candidates are scored, filtered, ranked and exported. The software provides
  a desktop workbench, a local web interface and command-line tools backed by
  the same analysis modules.
